{
  "name": "RIAA Phono Preamplifier",
  "description": "A moving-magnet phono preamplifier: an op-amp gain stage with the standard RIAA equalization feedback network (the three RIAA time constants 3180/318/75µs). Run an AC sweep (dec, 20Hz–20kHz) — the response follows the RIAA curve within 0.26dB, with ~40dB gain at 1kHz and high boost at low frequencies. (Validated on ngspice.)",
